the SaveData is a set.
this's Path is a text.

the Game is an actor.
this's State is a SaveData.

this can Save.
this's Save does...
    do this's Resolve.
    if that is Saved, Saved with that!
    or, failed with that's error!

this can Resolve.
this's Resolve does...
    if this's State exists?
        this is Saved with this's State!
    or?
        this is failed with error "no state"!

the App is a script.

Game's State is a SaveData with Path "/c".

do Game's Save...
    if that is Saved?
        log "saved".
        log that's Path.
    or?
        log that's error.
